setblock ~0 ~2 ~-6 minecraft:lectern[facing=south,has_book=true]{Book:{id:"minecraft:written_book",count:1,components:{"minecraft:written_book_content":{title:"Expedition Log",author:"You",pages:['"Day 1. Left the dome at first light. The water rises every year and the air above it burns. The council says no answer lies past the glass. I mean to find one. Fuel for nine days, air for twenty."','"Day 6. Past the last of the drowned towers. Kelp and sand in every direction. Fuel is lower than it should be. Turning for home."','"Day 7. Out of fuel, drifting. Then a bang from the stern and water in the engine bay. Sealed it off, but she would not hold her trim. Going down."','"Day 7, later. On the bottom, two hundred metres down. The hull held. The lights are gone and the motor with them. The airlock still works."','"The diving suit and the backtank are in the chest by the bunks. Wear all of it outside, the water crushes anyone without it this deep. The tank holds about fifteen minutes of air."','"The hand pump by the bunks still works, there is a spare tank standing on it. Hold the crank and it fills, a couple of minutes for a full tank. Break a tank to pick it up, set an empty one under the crank to fill it again."','"The nearest dome lies east, six or seven hundred blocks across open water. Too far on one tank. First air, then power, then get this boat moving again."']}}},Page:0} replace
